      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Porco. Swinub procura alimento escavando o solo com o focinho, e nem mesmo a terra congelada o impede. Ele esfrega o focinho no chão enquanto cava em busca de comida. Às vezes, acaba encontrando fontes termais.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Swinub pode evoluir para Piloswine no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Odor Sleuth, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Mud Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Powder Snow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Mud Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Icy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Ice Shard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Mist</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Amnesia, Blizzard</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Attract, Avalanche, Baby-Doll Eyes, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Charm, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Frustration, Hail, Haze, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Ice Beam, Ice Fang, Icicle Spear, Icy Wind, Light Screen, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Snowscape, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Superpower, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ancient Power, Avalanche, Bite, Body Slam, Curse, Double-Edge, Fissure, Freeze-Dry, Icicle Crash, Icicle Spear, Mud Shot, Stealth Rock, Take Down</p>",
